A command whose two blank functions in two files each leave a parameter unread. A
blank function is no platform twin of another, since nothing calls either, so
both parameters are reported.

-- go.mod --
module example.com/app

go 1.27
-- deadset.json --
{"target": {"kind": "application"}}
-- main.go --
package main

func main() {}

func _(unused int) { println() }
-- other.go --
package main

func _(spare int) { println() }
